@lucidrains Do you have any recommendation for now? 

@lucidrains I got rid of the problem for now by disabling code dropout. The problem is in the part of the `should_quantize_dropout` block:

```
           elif is_distributed():
                # in distributed environment, synchronize a random seed value if not given
                t = torch.tensor(random.randrange(10_000))
                dropout_seed = dist.all_reduce(t).item()
                rand = random.Random(dropout_seed)
```
